<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AWB says sold Iraq 250,000 T Australian wheat.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AWB says sold Iraq 250,000 T Australian wheat.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Wheat Board (AWB) said on Friday that 250,000 tonnes of Australian wheat has been sold to Iraq for January-February delivery.</p>
</text>
